I don't know what you did, but there should be no "area" that you're pasting it into to have any possible error. Whenever you use little snippets of code like that, you copy the code, paste it into a text editor, save it as a *.js file, include it as a plugin.
In this case, make sure that new plugin is below the one that you're modifying in your plugin manager.

